  "title50px-3": "Compose with the best of technology",
  "subtitle-hover-block-html-3": "\n            <p>Take advantage of a customized digital ecosystem that can be synchronized with the best solutions on the market.</p>\n            <p>Innovorder integrates with your favorite scheduling, home delivery and loyalty management software.</p>\n          ",
